Z||000003||DaRkLoRD||07-19-2000||02:22 AM||||A crown vic caught a Fiero? I dunno if that's good or bad.. LOL..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> Good that you caught a car thief, of course.. but the idea of a Ford catching a Fiero...... well that's just wrong man.. hehehehe<P>anyway, what kind of suspension is on police cars? and I bet they don't have the stock engine either, right?<P>Just out of curiosity.. do you think a 300HP V8 Fiero w/suspension mods could outrun a cop? (hehe.. I'd better stop watching all those action movies before I get myself in trouble here.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> )<P>------------------<BR> <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A> <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||1
