Z||000017||fiero56||07-20-2000||11:11 AM||||All the cops around here use Crown Vics since the Caprice is no longer made. I don't think the cops around here go cheap a$$ on anything. I live just off a moderatly busy street, and the cops are always parked on the side of it, next to our house. Once in a while, a cop will pull out to get someone, and they will just smoke those tires as they make a u-turn by swinging the rear end around. Plus, those engines sound sweet under heavy acceleration. There is no way a Fiero could outrun these in a straight line.||||reg||1
